# [The same app on glowcap and Goblins]($section.id('the-same-app-on-glowcap-and-goblins'))

The same Racket application code runs on glowcap's Racket binding and on
[Spritely Goblins](https://spritely.institute/goblins/), each through a small
backend module, timed head to head
across several small applications. The actors run in the Racket binding's vat.
It does not measure glowcap's Zig actor runtime or concurrent load.
“glowcap + time-travel” enables snapshot support but does not take snapshots.
The [benchmark methodology](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/bench/goblins/METHODOLOGY.md)
explains what is held constant.

