# [Time-travel: snapshot and restore]($section.id('time-travel-snapshot-and-restore'))

A snapshot saves every actor's state, and a restore rewinds them to it. This
run varies actor count and bytes per actor. glowcap and Goblins run on
different runtimes, so compare how cost scales with actor count rather than
their absolute times.

```=html
